# `collation_key` values recur under both regions, the join key, so per-region distinct counts
# summed above the join over-count: day 1 holds 2 distinct values and its per-region counts sum to
# 4. The fact leg carries the values as keys and the combine counts them once, above the join.
name: two-source-distinct-value-spanning-join-keys
metric: distinct_collation_keys
aggregate: count_distinct
column: collation_key
keys:
lookup: conformance_regions
rows:
text:2026-01-01	int:2
text:2026-01-02	int:2
